0  000001                IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.                                                                                    
   000002                PROGRAM-ID. VARCHAR1.                                                                                       
   000003                AUTHOR. ISAAC.                                                                                              
   000004                ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.                                                                                       
