   000044                                                                                                                            
   000045               * This is our group var that represents the sql table for VCHAR1                                             
   000046                01 VCHAR1-TABLE.                                                          BLW=00000+088         0CL51       
   000047                   05 VCHAR1-ID                  PIC S9(4) COMP.                          BLW=00000+088,0000000 2C          
   000048                                                                                                                            
   000049               *   FIRST_NAME in the database is a VARCHAR field                                                            
   000050                   05 VCHAR1-FIRST-NAME.                                                  BLW=00000+08A,0000002 0CL17       
   000051                      49 VCHAR1-FIRST-NAME-LEN   PIC S9(4) COMP.                          BLW=00000+08A,0000002 2C          
   000052                      49 VCHAR1-FIRST-NAME-DATA  PIC X(15).                               BLW=00000+08C,0000004 15C         
   000053                                                                                                                            
