   000318                                                                                                                            
   000319               *    First we will check for a single varchar field select.                                                  
   000320                                                                                                                            
   000321               *    Initalize the query values                                                                              
   000322                    MOVE LOW-VALUES TO VCHAR1-FIRST-NAME-DATA.                            IMP 52                            
