   000428                3000-HANDLE-SQLCODE.                                                                                        
   000429                    EVALUATE SQLCODE                                                      22                                
   000430                    WHEN 0                                                                                                  
   000431      1                  DISPLAY 'Row found'                                                                                
   000432                    WHEN 100                                                                                                
   000433      1                  DISPLAY 'Row not found'                                                                            
   000434                    WHEN OTHER                                                                                              
   000435      1                  DISPLAY 'Error while fetching the row' SQLCODE                   22                                
   000436                    END-EVALUATE.                                                                                           
